{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/21dd6c90855658b46d994ed6978d3a52.avif?t=1763675756\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistworld</strong> is a fantasy role-playing game filled with a classic atmosphere and a richly layered world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an age of upheaval where nations, races, and factions collide, you will follow the intertwined stories of many characters and experience an epic tale that blends a vast world, intricate structure, and deeply woven narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its familiar <strong>isometric perspective</strong> and map design inspired by classic RPGs, <i>Mistworld</i> delivers the immersive feeling of playing through a living fantasy novel \u2014 shaped by diverse perspectives and meaningful choices within its expansive universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>free combinations of classes, equipment, and skills</strong>, players can form their own parties and enhance the strategic depth and freedom of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, step into the grand narrative of <i>Mistworld</i>, where countless destinies intertwine across a world on the brink of change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/d1605ab8da5c8886f6794d0465d7ad4f.avif?t=1763675756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras_big/d1605ab8da5c8886f6794d0465d7ad4f.avif?t=1763675756 width=1560 height=1206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Meeting of Classic WRPG and JRPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mistworld</i> aims to merge the <strong>narrative depth of classic Western RPGs</strong> with the <strong>gameplay structure of traditional JRPGs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character, journey across a turbulent world, and encounter a variety of companions \u2014<br>sharing lighthearted banter, engaging in profound conversations,<br>and making <strong>critical choices</strong> that will shape the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat follows the <strong>classic side-view, turn-based system</strong> familiar to JRPG fans.<br>Elemental affinities, diverse skill and equipment combinations, and tactical flexibility<br>allow each character to take on different roles \u2014 from a resilient tank to a devastating attacker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory lies in mastering a wide array of skills \u2014<br>weakening your enemies while empowering yourself, stacking status effects,<br>exploiting elemental weaknesses, and using combat items with precision and timing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Western Edge of the World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the westernmost frontier of the known world lies <strong>Larnill</strong>,<br>a land divided among three great powers:<br>the <strong>Northern Alliance</strong> of tribes and city-states,<br>the <strong>Kingdom of Ersinell</strong>, and the <strong>Kingdom of Kellah</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the dominant force across Larnill, Ersinell has fallen into decline under King Robert\u2019s rule.<br>After a crushing defeat in the northern wars,<br>a peasant uprising was barely suppressed before a new rebellion \u2014 this time led by nobles \u2014 arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, rebel forces have rallied behind <strong>Edman</strong>,<br>a high noble of Kellah and the king\u2019s own nephew,<br>laying siege to the royal capital of <strong>Falldorn</strong>.<br>It is here, amid the flames of civil war, that your party\u2019s story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/6c91a2050a307c7080d625ffad7292be.avif?t=1763675756\" width=1152 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/a3aba2cbf1832c5661c3ddccf30762eb.avif?t=1763675756\" width=1152 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-view Turn-based Combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Fields, Maps, and Environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Narrative Text and Dialogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Branching Choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbol-based Encounter System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Slot System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Usage Limits per Battle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide Variety of Equipment Categories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Builds through Gear and Skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Roll System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lockpicking Mini-game</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435980?t=1763675756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435980?t=1763675756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/100e97a4d6fdb0252c3cc7b08db2ce859385a525/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763675756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/100e97a4d6fdb0252c3cc7b08db2ce859385a525/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763675756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3435990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/21dd6c90855658b46d994ed6978d3a52.avif?t=1763675756\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistworld</strong> is a fantasy role-playing game filled with a classic atmosphere and a richly layered world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an age of upheaval where nations, races, and factions collide, you will follow the intertwined stories of many characters and experience an epic tale that blends a vast world, intricate structure, and deeply woven narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its familiar <strong>isometric perspective</strong> and map design inspired by classic RPGs, <i>Mistworld</i> delivers the immersive feeling of playing through a living fantasy novel \u2014 shaped by diverse perspectives and meaningful choices within its expansive universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>free combinations of classes, equipment, and skills</strong>, players can form their own parties and enhance the strategic depth and freedom of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, step into the grand narrative of <i>Mistworld</i>, where countless destinies intertwine across a world on the brink of change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/d1605ab8da5c8886f6794d0465d7ad4f.avif?t=1763675756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras_big/d1605ab8da5c8886f6794d0465d7ad4f.avif?t=1763675756 width=1560 height=1206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Meeting of Classic WRPG and JRPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mistworld</i> aims to merge the <strong>narrative depth of classic Western RPGs</strong> with the <strong>gameplay structure of traditional JRPGs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character, journey across a turbulent world, and encounter a variety of companions \u2014<br>sharing lighthearted banter, engaging in profound conversations,<br>and making <strong>critical choices</strong> that will shape the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat follows the <strong>classic side-view, turn-based system</strong> familiar to JRPG fans.<br>Elemental affinities, diverse skill and equipment combinations, and tactical flexibility<br>allow each character to take on different roles \u2014 from a resilient tank to a devastating attacker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory lies in mastering a wide array of skills \u2014<br>weakening your enemies while empowering yourself, stacking status effects,<br>exploiting elemental weaknesses, and using combat items with precision and timing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Western Edge of the World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the westernmost frontier of the known world lies <strong>Larnill</strong>,<br>a land divided among three great powers:<br>the <strong>Northern Alliance</strong> of tribes and city-states,<br>the <strong>Kingdom of Ersinell</strong>, and the <strong>Kingdom of Kellah</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the dominant force across Larnill, Ersinell has fallen into decline under King Robert\u2019s rule.<br>After a crushing defeat in the northern wars,<br>a peasant uprising was barely suppressed before a new rebellion \u2014 this time led by nobles \u2014 arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, rebel forces have rallied behind <strong>Edman</strong>,<br>a high noble of Kellah and the king\u2019s own nephew,<br>laying siege to the royal capital of <strong>Falldorn</strong>.<br>It is here, amid the flames of civil war, that your party\u2019s story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/6c91a2050a307c7080d625ffad7292be.avif?t=1763675756\" width=1152 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/extras/a3aba2cbf1832c5661c3ddccf30762eb.avif?t=1763675756\" width=1152 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-view Turn-based Combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Fields, Maps, and Environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Narrative Text and Dialogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Branching Choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbol-based Encounter System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Slot System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Usage Limits per Battle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide Variety of Equipment Categories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Builds through Gear and Skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Roll System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lockpicking Mini-game</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["ProjectMist"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435980/header.jpg?t=1763675756","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Mistworld \u00a9 Fallen. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3435980/965605665/d7cd0c14240906446e3bd38234ad52aed8e69ee3/1762458183/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762460482","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3435980/965605665/d7cd0c14240906446e3bd38234ad52aed8e69ee3/1762458183/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762460482","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3435980/965605665/d7cd0c14240906446e3bd38234ad52aed8e69ee3/1762458183/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762460482","id":257227842,"name":"Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227842/6d9872a7032cecc5e9ff24460d4e1f1b45e21bd4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762460482"}],"name":"Mistworld","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li>